//! Sample data for every platform feature, built with the same functions the API uses and a
//! controllable clock, so each solve, answer and result carries its own time. No challenge here
//! needs a container or a lab image: flags and multi-question challenges only.
//!
//! Every account gets one password, generated by each run and returned to the caller to show.

